* [2-9].*

# LLM-council session artifacts (one-off roast/analysis outputs, timestamped)
council-report-*.html
council-transcript-*.md

# Private meeting artifacts (never commit raw transcripts/summaries)
/transcript.md
/summaryA_F.md
/summaryB_P.md
/summaryC_L.md

# Private evaluation corpus and reports (Phase 2)
.adversaria-eval/
evaluation-reports/

# Launch-video render artifacts (source index.html + assets are tracked;
# renders/snapshots are reproducible via `npx hyperframes@0.7.42 render`)
marketing/launch-video/renders/
marketing/launch-video/snapshots/
marketing/launch-video/render.log
# v3/v4 are heavy render experiments (183M/95M) — too big for git; keep whole dirs
# out (use `git add -f` for a specific source file if one is ever worth tracking).
marketing/launch-video-v3/
marketing/launch-video-v4/

# Other agent's AI-generated fake screenshots (garbled text) — never used; keep out.
video/
